SUMMARY:The Rays | Fridays In The RAD Music Series
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to have The RAYS from Music Academy-Asheville perform on Friday\, May 29 starting at 6pm. Free music\, tacos and cool drinks! Join us for a fun evening of entertainment!\n\n\n\n\nRecords in the RAD in the River Arts District is a thoughtfully curated record store with an eclectic selection of vinyl\, both new and used. In addition to records\, we also have a music inspired art gallery\, which features artwork from Brian\, Dylan and Susan Haynes. recordsintherad.com \nAt Wedge Brewing\, we got our start in the River Arts District\, and therefore hold art and community very close to us. We create beer for the creatives and give them a place to commune. wedgebrewing.com \n  \nScreenshot\n  \n  \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/the-rays-fridays-in-the-rad-music-series/
LOCATION:Records in the RAD/The Wedge
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
